{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026k5uGKdvC4t1795757276.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>區內股市向好，港股曾升逾200點。</p><p></p><p>恒指高開36點後，最多升逾210點，上試22,400點水平。</p><p></p><p>科網股普遍向上，阿里巴巴升百分之3，重上85元水平，騰訊也升百分之1。</p><p></p><p>晶片股顯著反彈，華虹升百分之9，連同中芯包辦藍籌升幅榜首兩位。</p><p></p><p>個別資源股受壓，配股集資67億元的神華，股價跌百分之6。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:23:53.396704+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T05:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:12.196825+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:15.543341+00:00","content_hash":"852790e5831b808da8617d1d54c8fc4812173a313ff4f437a5ab195b51de808b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:23:53.396704+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}